# A Luxel library scene — Apache-2.0. Grammar: library/README.md.
# A bedside clock that does not light the room: a drifting star sky held dim
# by a ramp whose LAST stop is dark (the ramp clamps above it, so nothing in
# the sky can get brighter than 24345c), and the time in a night-vision red.
S - Night Clock
U 32 32
L pat 0 0 0 0 normal 100 none fill 1
N Sky
I @pat/starfield-2d
C sliderMode 65536
R 100 0:01030a 255:24345c
L text 0 12 0 0 normal 100 black fill 1
N Time
T clock hh:MM
F large b04a14 c none 0
